[Umbriel Link]
title=Umbriel Link
description=Phone and desktop continuity: QUIC on the default Link port, Quick Share over TCP, and mDNS so phones find the desktop
ports=4717/udp|4718/tcp|5353/udp

[Umbriel Link LocalSend]
title=Umbriel Link LocalSend
description=LocalSend compatibility, only while Visible to LocalSend is on: HTTPS and multicast discovery
ports=53317/tcp|53317/udp
